  triage:title "AV.3 QA-history round-2 part-1 entry cites 91 boundary-enforcement tests but omits the 97-test package total the gate criteria named" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-r5 new minor: in docs/plans/phase-av/sprint-AV.3-mechanical-hard-gates.md the QA-history round-2 part-1 entry (line 232: 'all 91 architecture tests pass against the real AV.1b tree') records only the boundary_enforcement.rs count; cargo test -p atm-architecture actually runs 97 tests (91 boundary-enforcement + 1 graft + 3 member-state + 2 pending-nudge) and the fix-r4 acceptance criteria / QA verdict were stated against the package total. Fix: state both numbers (91 boundary-enforcement / 97 package) in the QA-history entry and wherever the doc cites the architecture-test count as evidence." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-av" ;
